:: Tree Left {"position":"650,400","size":"100,100"}
You look left and see a pile of splendifferous delkrams. As you wonder what a delkram is, the bear climbs the tree and kills you.


:: Tree Right {"position":"775,400","size":"100,100"}
You look right and see a timid little ostrich. You jump down and run to it. You decide to keep it as a pet.
(set: $name to (prompt: "What do you name it?")) { (if: (lowercase: $name) is 'svenholt')[ (go-to: "Likes Name") ](else-if: (lowercase: $name) is 'sanchez')[ (go-to: "Likes Name") ](else:)[ (go-to: "Dislikes Name") ] }


:: Under Pressure {"position":"275,400","size":"100,100"}
You sing and the bear puts pressure on your skull and kills you.


:: Under a Bush {"position":"775,150","size":"100,100"}
The bear sees you hide, finds you, and kills you.


:: Yell {"position":"525,150","size":"100,100"}
You decide to yell. Yell what? [[Yippee->Yell Yipee]] [[Help->Yell Help]]


:: Yell Help {"position":"275,525","size":"100,100"}
You yell help and the bear helps himself to your delicious body.


:: Yell Yipee {"position":"150,525","size":"100,100"}
You yell yipee and square dance with the bear. When you finish the bear thanks you for the dance.


:: You Win {"position":"900,525","size":"100,100"}
=><= ##You Win! Play Again? [[Yes->Start]] [[No->Start]]


:: StoryStylesheet [stylesheet]
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=VT323&display=swap');

.vt323-regular {
  font-family: "VT323", monospace;
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
  color: #333b
}

tw-story {
  width: 100vw;
  padding-top: 3.5rem;
  background-color: #99cc66;
  color: #333;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  font-family: "VT323", monospace;
  text-shadow: 2px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

tw-link, .enchantment-link {
    color: #333;
}

/* Color of links pointing to already visited passages */
.visited, .visited:hover {
  color: #333;
}

tw-sidebar {
    display: none;
}

.spacer {
  height: 15vh;
}

.pixel-corners--wrapper {
  /* This is the new shadow effect */
  filter: drop-shadow(2px 2px 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
  /* 1. Inline-flex completely neutralizes vertical text baseline padding */
  display: inline-flex;
  width: fit-content;
  height: fit-content;
  position: relative;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  vertical-align: middle;

  clip-path: polygon(0px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 2px), 8px 100%, calc(100% - 8px) 100%, calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 2px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 2px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 8px), 100% calc(100% - 8px), 100% 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 0px, 8px 0px, 8px 2px, 4px 2px, 4px 4px, 2px 4px, 2px 8px, 0px 8px);
}

.pixel-corners {
  /* 2. Forces inner container to behave identically */
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  
  position: relative;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
  
  /* Safe padding and exact font handling */
  padding: 6px 12px;
  line-height: 1.2;
  
  clip-path: polygon(0px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 2px), 8px 100%, calc(100% - 8px) 100%, calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 2px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 2px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 8px), 100% calc(100% - 8px), 100% 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 0px, 8px 0px, 8px 2px, 4px 2px, 4px 4px, 2px 4px, 2px 8px, 0px 8px);
}

/* 3. Aggressively clears out any paragraph layout blocks injected by Harlowe */
.pixel-corners p,
.pixel-corners tw-expression,
.pixel-corners tw-hook,
.pixel-corners tw-passage {
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  display: inline !important;
}

.pixel-corners--wrapper .pixel-corners {
  clip-path: polygon(2px 8px, 4px 8px, 4px 4px, 8px 4px, 8px 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 8px));
}

.pixel-corners::after,
.pixel-corners--wrapper::after {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  background: #333;
  display: block;
  pointer-events: none;
  clip-path: polygon(0px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 2px), 8px 100%, calc(100% - 8px) 100%, calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 2px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 2px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 8px), 100% calc(100% - 8px), 100% 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 0px, 8px 0px, 8px 2px, 4px 2px, 4px 4px, 2px 4px, 2px 8px, 0px 8px, 0px 50%, 2px 50%, 2px 8px, 4px 8px, 4px 4px, 8px 4px, 8px 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 2px, calc(100% - 8px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 4px, calc(100% - 4px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) 8px, calc(100% - 2px) calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 4px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 4px), calc(100% - 8px) calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 2px), 8px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 4px), 4px calc(100% - 8px), 2px calc(100% - 8px), 2px 50%, 0px 50%);
}

.pixel-corners::after {
  margin: -2px;
}

.flex-box {
  width: 100vw;
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-around;
  align-items: stretch;
  row-gap: 10px;
}
.flex-boxz {
  display: grid;
  /* Adjust the '200px' below to dictate the exact width of your boxes */
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300px, auto));
  
  /* Grid gaps bypass Harlowe's hidden tags completely */
  row-gap: 20px;     
  column-gap: 15px;  
}

.flex-item {
  padding-bottom: 150px;
}